{
  "uid": "sixnine-generation-pipeline",
  "title": "Inkseq generation pipeline",
  "description": "Cloud telemetry is diagnostic evidence. PostgreSQL remains job, attempt, output and billing authority. Missing telemetry does not mean no running GPU.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "tags": [
    "sixnine",
    "dstack",
    "hatchet",
    "generation"
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Cloud metrics",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "DS_LOKI",
        "label": "Cloud logs",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "provider",
        "label": "Provider",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, provider)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, provider)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "profile",
        "label": "Model profile",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, profile_id)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, profile_id)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "mode",
        "label": "FL / REF",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, mode)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, mode)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "gpu",
        "label": "GPU",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, gpu_type)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, gpu_type)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "warmth",
        "label": "Cold / warm",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, warmth)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_count, warmth)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "job_id",
        "label": "Job or attempt ID (optional)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "",
            "value": "",
            "selected": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Stage start events are exported before completion; inspect logs for starts without matching finishes. Telemetry is bounded and best effort: absence or a missing finish is **not** permission to rerun or rent again. Check the original business job/attempt and provider run. Compare GPU/model/steps/resolution/reference count and cold/warm state before interpreting timings. This dashboard has no access to the business database, user media or prompts. Costs and live machine authority remain in the operator console."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Completed stage median",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, stage, provider, mode, warmth) (rate(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{provider=~\"$provider\",profile_id=~\"$profile\",mode=~\"$mode\",gpu_type=~\"$gpu\",warmth=~\"$warmth\",outcome=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{provider}} {{mode}} {{warmth}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Completed stage p95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, stage, provider, mode, warmth) (rate(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{provider=~\"$provider\",profile_id=~\"$profile\",mode=~\"$mode\",gpu_type=~\"$gpu\",warmth=~\"$warmth\",outcome=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{provider}} {{mode}} {{warmth}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Cold preparation vs warm model work",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, stage, provider, mode, warmth) (rate(sixnine_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{provider=~\"$provider\",profile_id=~\"$profile\",mode=~\"$mode\",gpu_type=~\"$gpu\",warmth=~\"$warmth\",stage=~\"image_pull|weights_download|model_load|mode_switch\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{provider}} {{mode}} {{warmth}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Failure / unknown stage observations",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (stage, provider, mode, outcome) (increase(sixnine_stage_finished_total{provider=~\"$provider\",profile_id=~\"$profile\",mode=~\"$mode\",gpu_type=~\"$gpu\",warmth=~\"$warmth\",outcome=~\"failure|unknown\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{provider}} {{mode}} {{warmth}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Per-attempt stage timeline (starts and finishes)",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_namespace=\"sixnine\",service_name=~\"sixnine-.*\"} |~ \"${job_id:regex}\" | json | provider=~\"$provider\" | profile_id=~\"$profile\" | mode=~\"$mode\" | gpu_type=~\"$gpu\" | warmth=~\"$warmth\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Safe diagnostic failures and uncertainty",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_namespace=\"sixnine\",service_name=~\"sixnine-.*\"} |~ \"${job_id:regex}\" | json | provider=~\"$provider\" | profile_id=~\"$profile\" | mode=~\"$mode\" | gpu_type=~\"$gpu\" | warmth=~\"$warmth\" | outcome=~\"failure|unknown\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Recovery and comparison",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Expand a log to inspect `stage_id`, `job_id`, `attempt_id`, `dstack_run`, `hatchet_run`, `trace_id`, `gpu_index`, dimensions, steps and reference counts. IDs are log fields, never metric labels. Search a trace ID in the existing Cloud Tempo data source. `listed_memory_gib` is not a cgroup memory ceiling; compare `cgroup_memory_gib` separately. A recorded `end_to_end` ends only after validated output has committed and is downloadable. Exact claim, cancellation, billing and retry decisions belong to the original ledger."
      }
    }
  ]
}
